              {
                "id": "e53060c1-da55-400e-bdf7-a1793ad22ab6",
                "type": "text",
                "styleId": "text-default",
                "style": {
                  "padding": "0",
                  "margin": "0"
                },
                "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>开发语言：</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 10.5pt;\">Python</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>开发环境：</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 10.5pt;\">VS Code、Python 3.9、</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;思源黑体 Bold&quot;; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>Streamlit</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 10.5pt;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;思源黑体 Bold&quot;; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>ChromaDB</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 10.5pt;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;思源黑体 Bold&quot;; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>OpenAI API</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>开发内容：</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 10.5pt;\">基于</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;思源黑体 Bold&quot;; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong> RAG技术</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 10.5pt;\">实现智能文档问答系统。使用 PyPDF2、python-docx</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 实现 TXT/PDF/Word 文档解析及编码兼容；设计文本分块与本地多语言嵌入模</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 型， 并利用 ChromaDB 向量数据库实现语义检索；集成 OpenAI 兼容接口调用</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 通义千问大模型，构建包含文档去重、结果溯源的问答流程；采用 Streamlit 搭</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 10.5pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 建交互式 Web 界面，支持检索依据可视化</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;思源黑体 Bold&quot;; color: black; font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><strong>项目链接：</strong></span><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.modelscope.cn/studios/zm2389238/Smart-Doc-Chat\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;思源黑体 Bold&quot;; color: black; font-weight: bold; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><strong>https://www.modelscope.cn/studios/zm2389238/Smart-Doc-Chat</strong></span></a></p>",
                "children": [],
                "parentId": "4a13cab3-21d8-4ff4-9c23-d457e377c972"
