              {
                "id": "ea1371ed-d039-4fba-b951-240f46c92055",
                "type": "text",
                "styleId": "text-default",
                "style": {
                  "padding": "0",
                  "margin": "0"
                },
                "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>开发语言：</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;思源黑体 Bold&quot;; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>Python</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 11pt;\">、SQL</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>开发环境：</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 11pt;\">PyCharm、Python 3.9、Tkinter、</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;思源黑体 Bold&quot;; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>PyMySQL</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 11pt;\">、MySQL、SQLyog</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>开发内容：</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 11pt;\">参与</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;思源黑体 Bold&quot;; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>全流程开发</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 11pt;\">，负责用户</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;思源黑体 Bold&quot;; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>登录注册</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 11pt;\">、图书浏览、</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;思源黑体 Bold&quot;; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>购物车</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 11pt;\">及</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;思源黑体 Bold&quot;; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>订单</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 11pt;\">模块</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 的前后端实现；基于Tkinter构建图形界面，使用PyMySQL连接MySQL数据库，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 遵循MVC架构分层开发；</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;思源黑体 Bold&quot;; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>设计数据库表结构</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 11pt;\">（用户表、图书表、订单表、评价</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 表），通过事务保证订单数据安全；实现管理员后台的图书信息管理与订单处</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 理功能</span></p>",
                "children": [],
                "parentId": "cfabbb62-b289-4695-8d60-1bc801cc21e9"
              }
