        },
        "content": "<ul><li><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt;\">•</span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>编程语言：</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-size: 11pt;\">熟悉 Python、Java，具备扎实的编程能力和良好的算法基础</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt;\">•</span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>数据库：</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-size: 11pt;\">熟练掌握 MySQL、SQL Server，能编写复杂 SQL 语句与事务控制，了解 ChromaDB 向量数据库及语义检索原理</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt;\">•</span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>AI 应用开发：</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-size: 11pt;\">掌握 RAG（检索增强生成）全流程开发，包括文本分块、嵌入模型调用、向量检索；具备大模型应用集成经验，能通过 OpenAI 兼容接口调用云端模型</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt;\">•</span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>Linux 环境：</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-size: 11pt;\">熟悉 Linux 命令行操作，可独立搭建 VMware 虚拟机及 WSL / Ubuntu 开发环境</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt;\">•</span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>版本控制：</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-size: 11pt;\">熟练使用 </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;思源黑体 Bold&quot;; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>Git</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-size: 11pt;\"> 进行版本控制与分支管理</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt;\">•</span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>Web 应用部署：</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-size: 11pt;\">熟悉 Tomcat 部署，了解 Maven 依赖管理</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt;\">•</span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>框架与文档处理：</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 思源黑体; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-size: 11pt;\">掌握 Streamlit 框架快速构建交互式应用，了解 PyPDF2、python-docx 等文档解析技术</span></p></li></ul>",
